Original commit body from 937594e:

Add NameResolver and ListNameResolver classes to handle the different
registry formats used by language analyzers:

- NameResolver: For dict[str, Symbol] registries (JS/TS, Java, C#, etc.)
  Provides suffix matching so "doWork" can find "MyClass.doWork"

- ListNameResolver: For dict[str, list[Symbol]] registries (Go)
  Handles disambiguation among multiple candidates using path hints

Integrate the resolvers into Go, JavaScript/TypeScript, and Java analyzers:

- Go: Replace _resolve_callee with ListNameResolver.lookup()
- JS/TS: Add NameResolver for function call resolution
- Java: Add NameResolver for method call resolution

All resolvers provide lazy index building, confidence tracking,
and path hint disambiguation. 46 new tests added for comprehensive coverage.
